{# Hidden authorship for Webmention discovery — https://indieweb.org/authorship Lives INSIDE the post's h-entry root. Provides the entry's single u-url (the permalink) and a nested p-author h-card (name + url + photo). Bare include, zero shortcodes — interlinker-safe. ⚠ The photo is a <data value>, not an <img>: Chrome downloads an <img> even inside [hidden], lazy or not. #}
<div hidden>
  <a class="u-url" href="{{ page.url | url | absoluteUrl(meta.url) }}">{{ title }}</a>
  <p class="p-author h-card">
    <a class="p-name u-url" rel="author" href="{{ meta.url }}">{{ meta.author.name }}</a>
    <data class="u-photo" value="{{ meta.author.avatar | url | absoluteUrl(meta.url) }}"></data>
  </p>
</div>
